k tracking<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/majestic.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Majestic SEO<\/a><\/td><td>Trust flow, citation flow<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/search.google.com\/search-console\/about\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Google Search Console<\/a><\/td><td>Monitor current backlinks<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><a href=\"https:\/\/www.helpareporter.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">HARO<\/a><\/td><td>High-authority PR backlinks<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Off-Page SEO Mistakes to Avoid<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Buying cheap backlinks:<\/strong> These bring penalties and long-term damage.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Linking from irrelevant niches<\/strong>: Irrelevant backlinks dilute your authority.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Using the same anchor text repeatedly<\/strong>: Leads to unnatural link profile.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Ignoring no-follow links<\/strong>: They still help your link diversity and trust.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Focusing only on quantity, not quality<\/strong>: 10 good links &gt; 1,000 spam links.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-d72f351059e80039135382f58233f821\"><strong>Explore Our Most Popular Marketing Courses<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogTable&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Course<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-ce